  },
  {
    "id": 2002020110080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですね……\r\n一言では言い表しにくいのですが──……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202011/2002020110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020110090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "この前……思いがけない再会をしたんです",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202011/2002020110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020110100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そのおかげで、卒業や別れは寂しいもの\r\nではあるのですが……",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202011/2002020110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020110110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "──そこで全て終わりじゃないのかな……\r\nと思えたんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202011/2002020110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020110120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "たとえ、その時にすごく仲良くなかったとしても、\r\nその後のどこかで、つながりができることもあります",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202011/2002020110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020110130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ですので……そういう気持ちを込めて演じました",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202011/2002020110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ドラマスタッフ",
    "text": "なるほど～その気持ち私には\r\nバッチリ伝わってきてましたよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020110140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ、ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202011/2002020110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ドラマスタッフ",
    "text": "じゃあ次は……\r\n────このドラマを見てもらいたい人はいますか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020110150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "もちろん、ファンのみなさんに\r\n見ていただけたら嬉しいです……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202011/2002020110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002020110160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………\r\nそれと──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
